      {
        "name": "places/ChIJdRnmBgz_AzQRVz54Lb3pY0Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poclRpMUdhMGhSZEhsTmFFUmFhVzUzWDNOS2EzYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "這裡的排骨更像是中式排骨，而不是德州排骨……其他菜色都相當不錯。\n\n稍微有點鹹，但週六早午餐每人300美元的價格很划算。\n\n每樣都來一份！\n\n座位比市中心那家好。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The ribs are more like Chinese ribs than Texas ribs…everything else is pretty good\n\nA bit too much on the Salty side but $300 per pax Saturday Brunch is a good deal.\n\nYou get one of everything!\n\nThe seating is better than Central location.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Mr Wong",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117491824621064026710/reviews",
