      {
        "name": "places/ChIJdRnmBgz_AzQRVz54Lb3pY0Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZMmJXUlNlR3d6WVdoSVl6TmlOVk01T1hWcFYxRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "太開心他們開了新店！食物一如既往地美味，我還很喜歡一些新品，例如牛臉肉雪茄捲！這也是我第一次嘗試他們家的飲品，他們的「德州拐杖」我可以喝十杯😝",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "So happy they opened a new location! Food is as good as always and I loved some new items like the Beef Cheek Cigars! It was also my first time trying some of their drinks and I could drink 10 of their Texas Crutch 😝",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
