      {
        "name": "places/ChIJdRnmBgz_AzQRVz54Lb3pY0Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psbmNFa3diRWM1ZEdGc2NHVnVXalpRVjFWeFdWRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "很高興在SYP有這家店。店面大小合適，可以容納很多人。食物一如既往地美味，服務也很棒。午餐套餐的選擇也很豐富。期待下次光臨。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Very happy to have a location in SYP. The space is a good size and can accommodate plenty of people. The food was really good (as always) with awesome service. Great selection for the set lunch menus as well. Looking forward to returning.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
